---
layout: base.njk
title: Request a Quote
description: Get a custom quote for Disco Carrot at your ski resort or venue.
permalink: /request-quote/
---
<style>
  .quote-hero {
    padding: 160px 48px 40px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .quote-hero .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange); margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .quote-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .quote-hero p {
    font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .quote-body {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 48px 100px;
  }
  .or-divider {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 48px 0;
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;
  }
  .or-divider::before,
  .or-divider::after {
    content: '';
    flex: 1; height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(--slate), transparent);
  }
  .quote-body .cta-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ice); text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .cal-link-wrapper { text-align: center; }
  .cal-link {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--midnight); background: var(--orange);
    padding: 16px 36px; border-radius: 2px;
    text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .cal-link:hover { background: var(--gold); transform: translateY(-3px); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .quote-hero { padding: 120px 24px 40px; }
    .quote-body { padding: 20px 24px 80px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="quote-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">For Resorts & Venues</p>
  <h1>Request a Quote</h1>
  <p class="eyebrow">Have a good idea of what you need for your event? Fill out the form below and we'll get back to you with a custom quote.</p>
</div>

<div class="quote-body">
  <script type="text/javascript" src="https://form.jotform.com/jsform/260286183364056"></script>

  <div class="or-divider">Or</div>

  <p class="cta-text">Prefer to start an immediate conversation? Schedule a time to chat on our calendar.</p>
  <div class="cal-link-wrapper">
    <a href="https://cal.com/disco-carrot/resort-and-venue" class="cal-link" data-cal-link="disco-carrot/resort-and-venue" data-cal-namespace="resort" data-cal-config='{"layout":"month_view","theme":"dark"}'>Schedule a Call →</a>
  </div>
</div>

<script type="text/javascript">
Cal("init", "resort", { origin: "https://cal.com" });
Cal.ns["resort"]("ui", {
  theme: "dark",
  styles: { branding: { brandColor: "#FF5C00" } },
  hideEventTypeDetails: false,
  layout: "month_view"
});
</script>
